  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 100,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Model Runtime Guide",
      "description": "Action guide for model runtime drill-down. No Data means check vLLM/cAdvisor scrape and labels.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 5
      },
      "targets": [],
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "## 모델 런타임 상세 / Model runtime runbook\n- `$model`과 `$runtime_service`를 좁혀 특정 runtime 병목을 확인합니다.\n- queue가 높고 token throughput이 낮으면 vLLM scheduling/KV/cache 압박을 의심합니다.\n- container CPU/RAM은 cAdvisor recording rule 기반입니다. No Data는 cAdvisor scrape 또는 compose service label을 확인합니다.\n"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {},
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Token Throughput",
      "description": "Healthy/정상: expected range. Attention/주의: review trend. Action Required/조치 필요: investigate owner/runbook. No Data/런타임 데이터 없음: check Prometheus scrape/exporter.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(vllm_token_throughput_per_second{model=~\"$model\",runtime_service=~\"$runtime_service\"}) by (model)",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "{{model}}"
        }
      ],
      "options": {},
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ops",
          "decimals": 2
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Queue Depth",
      "description": "Healthy/정상: expected range. Attention/주의: review trend. Action Required/조치 필요: investigate owner/runbook. No Data/런타임 데이터 없음: check Prometheus scrape/exporter.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 6,
        "y": 5,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "max(vllm_queue_depth{model=~\"$model\",runtime_service=~\"$runtime_service\"}) by (model)",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "{{model}}"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "center",
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 20
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 50
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "KV Cache Usage",
      "description": "Healthy/정상: expected range. Attention/주의: review trend. Action Required/조치 필요: investigate owner/runbook. No Data/런타임 데이터 없음: check Prometheus scrape/exporter.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 5,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "max(vllm_kv_cache_usage_ratio{model=~\"$model\",runtime_service=~\"$runtime_service\"}) by (model)",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "{{model}}"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "center",
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "decimals": 2,
          "min": 0,
          "max": 1,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 0.8
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 0.9
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Upstream p95 Latency (5m)",
      "description": "Healthy/정상: < 5s. Attention/주의: 5–10s. Action Required/조치 필요: > 10s. No Data/런타임 데이터 없음: check Prometheus scrape/exporter. Uses recording rule model_runtime_upstream_p95_latency_seconds with fixed 5m window — not affected by $window variable.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 18,
        "y": 5,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "max(model_runtime_upstream_p95_latency_seconds{target=~\"$model\"}) by (target)",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "{{target}}"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "center",
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "decimals": 3,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 5.0
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 10.0
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Queue Depth Trend",
      "description": "Healthy/정상: queue depth near 0. Attention/주의: queue > 20 sustained. Action Required/조치 필요: queue > 50 or growing without bound. No Data/런타임 데이터 없음: check vLLM scrape and model/runtime_service labels.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 9,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 6
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "vllm_queue_depth{model=~\"$model\",runtime_service=~\"$runtime_service\"}",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "{{model}}"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "KV Cache Usage Trend",
      "description": "Healthy/정상: KV cache < 80%. Attention/주의: KV cache 80–90%. Action Required/조치 필요: KV cache > 90% — reduce context/concurrency. No Data/런타임 데이터 없음: check vLLM scrape and model/runtime_service labels.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 6,
        "y": 9,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 6
      },
